        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "BURGUNDY",
        "accent": "BURGUNDY"
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "They are simply the slow, necessary work of choosing reality over expectation.",
